{"schemaVersion":1,"code":"G1-06","example":{"issue":{"title":"斜交角度過小與主要道路轉向空間問題","intro":"主要道路寬約 20 m、速限 60 km/h，設有快慢車道及中央分隔；次要道路寬約 6 m、速限 30 km/h。","images":[{"key":"results:g1-06-diagram-1","label":"現況圖","role":"diagram","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g1-06-photo-1","label":"現況照片","role":"photo","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g1-06-photo-2","label":"現況照片 2","role":"photo","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g1-06-photo-3","label":"現況照片 3","role":"photo","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g1-06-photo-4","label":"現況照片 4","role":"photo","rotation":0}],"items":[{"id":"visibility","title":"斜交角度過小，來車觀察困難","text":"次要道路與主要道路交角過小，車輛停等時不易觀察主要道路來車，可能產生視線死角。"},{"id":"turn","title":"主要道路缺少左、右轉空間","text":"主要道路未妥善配置轉向車道，左轉車輛停等可能影響直行，右轉車輛則須跨越慢車道。"},{"id":"priority","title":"路口位置與轉向警示不足","text":"次要道路交通量較少，主要道路缺少明確的岔路警示，駕駛不易提前注意轉向車輛。"}],"photoStatus":"available"},"sourceSlides":[71,72],"strategy":{"title":"斜交路口正交化與左、右轉車道配置","intro":"透過調整次要道路交角及主要道路車道配置，改善來車觀察條件，並提供轉向車輛適當的行駛空間。","images":[{"key":"results:g1-06-strategy","label":"整體佈設圖","rotation":0}],"items":[{"id":"angle","title":"調整次要道路交角","text":"將次要道路接近路口的線形調整為近 90 度銜接，使車輛能以接近垂直主要道路的方向停等及觀察來車。","moduleId":"M2-01"},{"id":"turn","title":"配置左轉及直右車道","text":"主要道路依行車方向配置左轉車道與直右車道，減少左轉停等對直行車流的干擾。","moduleId":"M1-01"},{"id":"continuity","title":"調整路口前快慢車道分隔","text":"於路口前約 30～60 m 調整快慢車道分隔，改以混合車道及車道線配置，配合指向線引導直行與右轉車流。","moduleId":"M1-01"},{"id":"yield","title":"設置次要道路讓路設施","text":"於次要道路設置讓路線及讓路標誌。若讓路線位於曲線段，讓路標誌可往上游移至較易辨識的位置。","moduleId":"M2-01"}]},"strategySource":{"file":"chapters/04-general-scenarios/04-1-06-unsignalized-rural-skewed-t.typ","sha256":"5b7389ee42ffe730ee30a7795e20f834bb78be14fe8c4103b9a99f7743ee84d8","section":"交通設施設置建議與整體設置圖例"}},"assets":{"results:g1-06-diagram-1":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/current-conditions/G1-06/G1-06_現況圖_01.png","width":2414,"height":2637,"label":"G1-06 現況圖","scenario":"G1-06","role":"diagram","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":71,"sourcePart":"ppt/media/image82.png","sha256":"61c6156aa7895f17ea3a2773e3e8168353e09e757cdd3ecc29eb8c941d96c63d"},"results:g1-06-photo-1":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/current-conditions/G1-06/G1-06_現況照片_01.png","width":2498,"height":1389,"label":"G1-06 現況照片","scenario":"G1-06","role":"photo","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":72,"sourcePart":"ppt/media/image85.png","sha256":"f3b6d3e107b648624efa26c57167b89f8dc96c2c54f3d35f858f2b4feca95565"},"results:g1-06-photo-2":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/current-conditions/G1-06/G1-06_現況照片_02.png","width":2509,"height":1414,"label":"G1-06 現況照片 2","scenario":"G1-06","role":"photo","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":72,"sourcePart":"ppt/media/image83.png","sha256":"4c6542fcf9e2489c141d14f7cf8e1c7e51d78498e094b7ae29b1d9791e83853a"},"results:g1-06-photo-3":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/current-conditions/G1-06/G1-06_現況照片_03.png","width":2491,"height":1385,"label":"G1-06 現況照片 3","scenario":"G1-06","role":"photo","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":72,"sourcePart":"ppt/media/image86.png","sha256":"22f6253bb437ba62ac44ac78ff7b1cf878fee98e3abad3d99ef1c82830d176a7"},"results:g1-06-photo-4":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/current-conditions/G1-06/G1-06_現況照片_04.png","width":2525,"height":1407,"label":"G1-06 現況照片 4","scenario":"G1-06","role":"photo","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":72,"sourcePart":"ppt/media/image84.png","sha256":"b9eb48e40d8ee12a1d8bdedc3dab1704afe949155f54f3a8803f553b77af311f"},"results:g1-06-strategy":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/G1-06/G1-06_無號誌鄉區斜交三叉路口交通設施整體設置圖例.svg","width":879,"height":1699,"label":"G1-06 整體佈設圖","scenario":"G1-06","role":"strategy","sha256":"1b74c5a344362773ef2ccb14288c9a921dd11c0eb13cf8e3ada51ad009d6e282"}}}
